ms i used the stones to  destroy the stones  where are the stones gone  reduced to atoms you used them two days  ago  i used the stones to destroy the stones  now this is actually very important  phrasing and the russo brothers did  comment on this as well  after avengers in game they were being  interviewed and they were asked about  the infinity stones and their response  was the infinity stones  aren't actually gone thanos just reduced  them to  atoms but they implied that they could  be put back together  and right now if there's any person in  the marvel cinematic universe that has  the potential  to put back together the infinity stones  it's definitely doctor strange  you have to remember that in the first  doctor strange film he did extensive  study on the time stone  and now it sounds like in doctor strange  in the multiverse of madness one of  three things are going to happen  when they talk about him doing research  on the time zone it could be one  he's already figured out a way to  somehow use magic and get the atoms of  the time stone and put it back together  now this could happen over the course of  the entire film or it could happen in  the very beginning we're not sure yet  the second option could be he's simply  doing research of  how to put it back together and the  third option is a little bit different  but  wanda could bring back the time stone  after all in the marvel cinematic  universe it does seem like she's already  brought back the mind stone the mind  stone was destroyed with all the other  infinity stones yet  in the one division trailer we see  vision and in his head  is the mind stone and in fact in one  particular scene it looks like  vision even uses the mind stone to  awaken agatha harkness when he touches  her head to wake her up we can clearly  see that it's the power of the mind  stone doing so  in whatever way the time stone comes  back we do know that it's of very big  importance the ancient one explained in  avengers end gam