lm  however there is one other villain that  makes absolutely perfect sense and will  most likely be a villain in doctor  strange in the multiverse of madness and  that is mephisto  now not only does mephisto have a very  large connection to doctor strange but  he also has a very large connection to  the scarlet witch and it's widely  believed that he is going to be a  villain  in the one division series and be  responsible for a lot of things  happening in the comics wanda envisions  kids are actually shards of the demon  mephisto  and he would eventually go on to want  them back and get them back therefore  eliminating wanda and vision's children  well it does look like that's going to  be the case for one division  because we do know that wiccan and speed  their two boys are going to be in the  show this is confirmed we've already  seen them but of course the question  is how does she have these kids are they  in the mcu shards of the demon mephisto  we've seen a lot of crazy things in the  one of vision trailer already and a lot  of things that point to mephisto  actually being in the show which means  since one division is going to lead up  to  and into doctor strange in the  multiverse of madness and since  wanda is going to be in the movie as  well and play a pretty big role  it would make sense that mephisto as a  villain would be a part of doctor  strange in the multiverse of madness as  well and since mephisto primarily is in  the hell dimension which he rules over  he can technically be released into the  main mcu dimension  this would definitely cause a lot of  problems for our master of the mystic  arts and it's actually widely believed  that evan peters who once played  quicksilver in the fox universe will be  playing mephisto in  the mcu now as far as a bonus option is  concerned for the villain there's always  the possibility that it could be wanda  and she could actually go insane  there's no doubt that she's one of the  strongest beings in the enti